 """
-HoTT Kernel — Unified Entry Point
+HoTT Kernel — Unified Entry Point (Thin Facade)
 Schema Version: 3.0.0-kernel
 
-Single entry point untuk seluruh analisis codebase.
-Menggantikan 13 tool calls terpisah menjadi 1.
-
-Usage:
-    python3 hott_kernel.py analyze src
-    python3 hott_kernel.py analyze src --analyzers topo.orphan,topo.entrypoint
-    python3 hott_kernel.py analyzers
+Decomposed into acyclic domain modules under core/kernel/:
+  - core.kernel.runtime       (shared imports, cache state, graph/engine runners)
+  - core.kernel.inspection    (topology, mermaid, analyze, impact, outline, brief, cycle-break, establish, synthesize, steer)
+  - core.kernel.memory_ops    (memory_*, xanalyze, xsteer, xcontext, fiber*)
+  - core.kernel.receipts      (task-chain receipt schema & graph-signature sealing)
+  - core.kernel.context_pack  (budgeted context pack assembly)
+  - core.kernel.work_policy   (resolve-target, evidence-needs, capability-match, work projections, kernel_work)
+  - core.kernel.task_chain    (bounded multi-stage task chain orchestration)
+  - core.kernel.cli_dispatch  (CLI argument parsing, _KERNEL_CLI_DISPATCH, main)
 """
 
