-    Output modes:
-    - "full"     : semua data termasuk shared_graph (default)
-    - "summary"  : hanya unified_summary + counts
-    - "findings" : findings analyzers + summary, tanpa shared_graph
-    - "graph"    : hanya shared_graph (tanpa file_map), tanpa analyzers
